Error [jet.NonExhaustiveOsDispatch]: This `#build.target.os` dispatch doesn't cover every target OS — missing: Web, Wasm, Freestanding
  --> tests/ui/os_target_dispatch_native_only.jet:2:5
    |
  2 |     #if #build.target.os == {
    |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: A build can target any OS of the list, native, web, Wasm or freestanding, so the dispatch must handle each one — otherwise a build for a missing OS would have no arm to run
 Fix: Add an arm for each missing OS (Web, Wasm, Freestanding), or name several in one arm, such as `.Web | .Wasm -> …`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E-OSTARGET-DISPATCH-EXHAUSTIVE
